{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gisela, a scylla of unusual beauty for her race, has always longed to be even more beautiful.<br>One night, she discovers a human singing a mysterious song by the shore. <br>The human, Aisha, is the most beautiful thing she has ever seen.<br>Consumed by envy, Gisela wants nothing more than to kill and devour her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Details -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning Song of the Stagnant Sea is a visual novel about the fated encounter of a human and a scylla. You will choose how the story progresses. Depending on your choices, Gisela may devour Aisha, or fight against her urges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What lurks beneath the surface of their souls? Peer into the depths of a fairytale about madness, sorrow, and love that transcends species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mermaid may yet find the happiness she was promised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Features -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPoint-and-click style visual novel interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPicture book style illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBranching story paths that lead to four unique endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbScene selection, a glossary, and a gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAn extra story unlocked after reaching at least one ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlaytime approx: 3 - 5 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gisela</strong>: A scylla in obsessive pursuit of greater beauty. Selfish and cruel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966180/extras/ae84cbf148c59090c7bc9ff6579dbed8.avif?t=1774425568\" width=300 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aisha</strong>: A woman who sings in silence after losing her voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966180/extras/ab5698e0afb98f63addc195463731cc9.avif?t=1774425568\" width=300 height=277 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966180?t=1774425568","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966180/f8b3962d84bdadd799f5eaef4999ab4fc3c0dd0e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774425568","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966180/1dd3e543cccc46a923941d954cc599766b5141ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774425568","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966180/1dd3e543cccc46a923941d954cc599766b5141ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774425568","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of murder, mutilation, suicide, human trafficking, sexual violence, and drug abuse.\r\nHowever, everything except bloodshed is expressed through text."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gisela, a scylla of unusual beauty for her race, has always longed to be even more beautiful.<br>One night, she discovers a human singing a mysterious song by the shore. <br>The human, Aisha, is the most beautiful thing she has ever seen.<br>Consumed by envy, Gisela wants nothing more than to kill and devour her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Details -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning Song of the Stagnant Sea is a visual novel about the fated encounter of a human and a scylla. You will choose how the story progresses. Depending on your choices, Gisela may devour Aisha, or fight against her urges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What lurks beneath the surface of their souls? Peer into the depths of a fairytale about madness, sorrow, and love that transcends species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mermaid may yet find the happiness she was promised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Features -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPoint-and-click style visual novel interface</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPicture book style illustrations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBranching story paths that lead to four unique endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbScene selection, a glossary, and a gallery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAn extra story unlocked after reaching at least one ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPlaytime approx: 3 - 5 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gisela</strong>: A scylla in obsessive pursuit of greater beauty. Selfish and cruel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966180/extras/ae84cbf148c59090c7bc9ff6579dbed8.avif?t=1774425568\" width=300 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aisha</strong>: A woman who sings in silence after losing her voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966180/extras/ab5698e0afb98f63addc195463731cc9.avif?t=1774425568\" width=300 height=277 /></span></p>","developers":["\u7a7a\u60f3\u306e\u5de5\u623f"],"dlc":[4453530],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966180/c13f4b373852f7ce62ec9a12d5d4f363fef25187/header.jpg?t=1774425568","is_fre